  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/4889_dancing.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Teacher Zhang recently had a new student. She is an eight-year-old girl. Her mother took her to learn to dance. After a month of class, the teacher discovered that the girl never smiled every time she attended class. It turned out that the girl's mother forced her to learn dancing, but the little girl didn't like it. The teacher asked this mother why she had to let her child learn to dance? The mother said that since she was a child, she thought people who could dance were beautiful, so she wanted her children to learn. The teacher said: Then the child will not come next time. She does not like it and is not happy. It is you who likes to dance, and you should be my student."
  ],
  "english_full": "Teacher Zhang recently had a new student. She is an eight-year-old girl. Her mother took her to learn to dance. After a month of class, the teacher discovered that the girl never smiled every time she attended class. It turned out that the girl's mother forced her to learn dancing, but the little girl didn't like it. The teacher asked this mother why she had to let her child learn to dance? The mother said that since she was a child, she thought people who could dance were beautiful, so she wanted her children to learn. The teacher said: Then the child will not come next time. She does not like it and is not happy. It is you who likes to dance, and you should be my student.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "На́ставник Чжан не́да́вно прине́с но́вого студе́нта. Э́та де́вочка восьми́ лет. Её ма́ма взя́ла её, чтобы она учи́лась танце́вать. По́сле ме́сяца заня́тий наста́вник обнару́жил, что де́вочка никогда́ не улы́балась каждый раз, когда она прису́тствовала на заня́тиях. О́казалось, что ма́ма де́вочки принудила её учи́ться танце́вать, но ма́ленькой де́вочке это не по́нрави́лось. На́ставник спросил ма́му, почему она должна́ позво́лить сво́ему ребёнку учи́ться танце́вать? Ма́ма ска́зала, что с тех пор как она была ребёнком, она ду́мала, что лю́ди, которые уме́ли танцева́ть, краси́вы, поэ́тому она хо́тела, чтобы её де́ти учи́лись. На́ставник ска́зал: «Тогда ребе́нок не приду́т в сле́дующий раз. Ей это не по́нрави́лось и она не счастли́ва. Это вы люби́те танцева́ть, а вам нужно быть мо́им студе́нтом.»"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Nástavnik Chzhan nédavno prinés nóvogo studénta. Éta devóchka vosʹmí let. Yeyó máma vzýala yey, chtoby ona uchílasʹ tancávatʹ. Pósle mésyatsa zanyátiy nástavnik obnarúzhil, chto devóchka nikogdá ne ulýbalasʹ kázhdyi raz, kogda ona prisútstvovala na zanyátiyakh. Ókazalosʹ, chto máma devóchki prinudila yey uchítsya tancávatʹ, no málenʹkoy devóchke eto ne pónravilosʹ. Nástavnik sprósil mámu, pochemu ona dolzhná pozvólitʹ svóemu rébyonku uchítsya tancávatʹ? Máma skázala, chto s tekh por kak ona byla rébyonkom, ona dúmala, chto lýudi, kotorye uméli tancávatʹ, krásivy, poétymu ona khótела, chtoby yey déti uchílisʹ. Nástavnik skázal: «Togda rébyonok ne pridút v sléduyushchiy raz. Éy eto ne pónravilosʹ i ona ne schastlíva. Éto vy lýbite tancávatʹ, a vam nuzhno bytʹ móim studéntom.»"
  ],
